   "subject": "Re: list of lavaan.matrices to data.frames",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "On 05/17/2015 04:21 PM, Antti Simola wrote:\r<br>&gt; require(lavaan)\r<br>&gt;     df &lt;-data.frame(\r<br>&gt;             y1=sample(1:100),\r<br>&gt;             y2=sample(1:100),\r<br>&gt;             x1 =sample(1:100),\r<br>&gt;             x2 =sample(1:100),\r<br>&gt;             x3 =sample(1:100),\r<br>&gt;             grpvar =sample(c(&quot;grp1&quot;,&quot;grp2&quot;),100,replace =T))\r<br>&gt;     semModel &lt;-list(length =2)\r<br>\r<br>This should be\r<br>\r<br>       semModel &lt;- vector(&quot;list&quot;, length = 2)\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "\r<br>&gt;     semModel[1]&lt;-&#39;y1 ~ c(a,b)*x1\r<br>&gt;                                y2 ~ c(a,b)*x2&#39;\r<br>&gt;     semModel[2]&lt;-&#39;y1 ~ c(a,b)*x1\r<br>&gt;                                y2 ~ c(a,b)*x2 + c(a,b)*x3&#39;\r<br>&gt;     funEstim &lt;-function(model){\r<br>&gt;         sem(model,data =df,group=&quot;grpvar&quot;,estimator =&quot;MLM&quot;)\r<br>&gt;     fits &lt;-lapply(semModel,funEstim)\r<br>&gt;     residuals &lt;-lapply(fits,function(x)resid(x,&quot;obs&quot;))\r<br>\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "What about\r<br>\r<br>Residuals &lt;- lapply(residuals, function(x) { lapply(x, as.data.frame) })\r<br>\r<br>Yves.\r<br>"
    ]
   ]
